	"hints": {"dead_leg":["读数来自测压口实际连通的那一段。按 Tab 看图纸：P-C01 和货舱之间还有一个阀门 V-C01。","A gauge reads whatever its port is connected to. Press Tab: there is a valve, V-C01, between P-C01 and the hold."],"dead_leg_hose":["V-C01 关着，软管只能抽到阀门外侧那一小段空管。","With V-C01 shut the hose only reaches the empty stub outside the valve."],"discharge_refused":["发电机或蓄电池还在给母线供电，先断开 K-G 和 K-B。","The generator or battery still feeds the bus — open K-G and K-B first."],"hatch_jam":["货舱门变形卡住了，先用 4 解除卡滞（HATCH-JAM）。","The hatch is bent and jammed — clear HATCH-JAM with tool 4 first."],"no_power":["舱门电机没电。船坞辅助电源 PWR-EXT 在 D 舱顶部外侧。","No power for the door motors. Dock aux socket PWR-EXT is on the roof above D."],"remote":["指令已发出。它真的停了吗？用测量工具去 E-D01 验证。","Command sent. Did it actually stop? Verify at E-D01."]},
